    ((prinDat A Z).Pg ∪ ∅) e he f₀ _ f hsb hth g hsupp
  exact GlobalTheory.T.weilMatrixCoefficient_eq_zero_of_heisenberg_relations D ψ A H χA 1 om hW ν 𝓕 hν f hthf g n a y h1 h2

